  "details": "I'm testing the new headchop component with my crocodile model. And as you can see in the image, I can successfully see some of the snout in my field of vision without the need to break down the head into different bones but, there's a weird empty space under it. Is it perhaps because of clipping? the ''skin'' of the snout been too thin? A mixture of both or even something completely different?\n\nI wonder if this can be fixed or tweaked in some way, to make the immersion experience better.",
